      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The menu from SAO is too vertical for a VR product. On the other hand, I could totally see UI described in Ready Player One as a part of VRChat, especially since I know this is what inspired VRChat Inc. in the first place. So, whatever they're going to do next is probably going to be just like in RPO, except crappy and boring. At least that's the way things should be expected.",
