  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-24T16:53:22.308Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It whoud be cool if the menu looked like In Sword Art Online, but and that the is not placed on one hand but instead placed in front of you and you can drag it around.\n\nAnd you could make it so that other people could see your menu.",
